        ["adbe.pkcs7.detached is a legacy (pre-PAdES) format: B-T and above need ETSI.CAdES.detached. Change the sub-filter in Cryptography."] = ("adbe.pkcs7.detached é um formato legado (pré-PAdES): B-T e acima precisam de ETSI.CAdES.detached. Mude o sub-filter em Criptografia.", "adbe.pkcs7.detached es un formato heredado (pre-PAdES): B-T y superiores necesitan ETSI.CAdES.detached. Cambie el sub-filter en Criptografía."),
